            <div xml:id="d117-a5">

                <pb facs="0360" n="302" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg302"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 4.</seg></opener>
                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Consul:</hi> According to his Majesty’s order I
                    beg you, as soon as possible, to place the emperor Maximilian in possession of
                    the telegram in cipher, hereto annexed. The orders of his Majesty are to
                    despatch it telegraphically by way of New Orleans, Florida, and Havana, and
                    thence by Vera Cruz, following the telegraph, to Mexico. As for the despatches
                    herewith, please also to have them reach Vera Cruz by the readiest means.</p>
                <p>Receive, Mr. Consular Agent, my cordial salutations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F. ELOIN, <hi rendition="#italic">Counsellor of State on
                        Service</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rosas</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Consular
                            Agent of the Empire of Mexico at New York</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
